The _Symbolic Programming_ module primarily focuses around the teaching of the [Prolog](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prolog) language.

[Prolog](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prolog) language features include:
- High level
- Declarative Syntax
- Functional Programming Style
